@IncidentResponseAgent.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5155

GET {{IncidentResponseAgent.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

POST {{IncidentResponseAgent.Api_HostAddress}}/api/incidents/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Checkout 5xx spike",
  "description": "Customers are seeing intermittent 500 responses during checkout.",
  "severity": "High",
  "serviceName": "checkout-api",
  "environment": "production",
  "tags": ["checkout", "5xx", "latency"]
}

###

GET {{IncidentResponseAgent.Api_HostAddress}}/api/incidents/recent?maxResults=5
Accept: application/json
